<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Desc starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Desc starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Baring's said it had started coverage of Mexico's Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a Jan 16 report, analyst Daniel Goldstein wrote that Desc's stock should &quot;appreciate by 18 percent per year for the next two years based on its earnings growth in 1997 and multiple expansion in 1998.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Desc's (American Depositary Share) should trade at $27.60 in 1997 and $32.90 in 1998.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 5/8 to 23-7/8 on Friday in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
